+    /// `look`, with another station's 400 Hz block at 1100-1500 Hz standing 10 dB over the
+    /// band's noise as it was, and an AGC answering it by turning the rest of the band 10 dB
+    /// down: the gateway's 20:27Z pre-roll of 2026-11-17 (`05-busy-band.md` §2.1).
